 "body_html": "<div class=\"kicker\"><span>Vol. I &middot; No. 151</span><span>Est. 2026</span><span>Price &middot; One Smile</span></div>\n<div class=\"hr-thick\"></div>\n<div class=\"the\">The</div><h1 class=\"mast\">Bentham Bulletin</h1>\n<div class=\"tag\">A Daily Almanac for the Family</div>\n<div class=\"orn\">&#127809; &#127810; &#127809;</div>\n<div class=\"dateline\">Sunday &middot; November 22 &middot; 2026</div>\n<div class=\"place\">North Tonawanda, New York &mdash; compiled at dawn</div>\n<div class=\"dbl-tight\"><div class=\"a\"></div><div class=\"b\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"tiles\">\n  <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"v\">65&deg;</div><div class=\"k\">Mostly Sunny</div></div>\n  <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"v\">4:46</div><div class=\"k\">Sunset</div></div>\n  <div class=\"tile urg\"><div class=\"v\">4</div><div class=\"k\">Days to Thanksgiving</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-wrap\"><div class=\"frame\"><span class=\"tick tl\"></span><span class=\"tick tr\"></span><span class=\"tick bl\"></span><span class=\"tick br\"></span>\n<img src=\"__PLATE__\" alt=\"A boy sitting in a red wheelbarrow in a front yard\"></div>\n<div class=\"plate-cap\">Plate I &middot; The Family Album</div>\n<div class=\"plate-sub\">Riding in the wheelbarrow</div></div>\n<div class=\"part\"><span>The News</span></div>\n<div class=\"wire lead\"><div><span class=\"kick\">The Lead</span><h3>Storms Line Up for Thanksgiving Week</h3>\n<p>A new round of storms is expected to hit both coasts early this week, just as people head out for the holiday, NPR reports. San Francisco's mayor asked people there to skip travel unless it is essential, with extreme high tides and rain forecast from Monday afternoon through Wednesday.</p>\n<p>It has already been a wet fall across much of the country. California saw mudslides, waterspouts and flooding this past week, and Florida had coastal flooding and streets under water. NPR traces part of it to a strong El Ni&ntilde;o, a warming of the Pacific that shifts weather around the world.</p>\n<p>Closer to home, no big storm is in the forecast, but the weather service gives Thanksgiving Day about a 50-50 chance of rain and snow showers starting after 7 a.m., with a high near 43. That takes in the 9 a.m. Turkey Trot. Anyone flying out of state this week should check their airline before leaving for the airport.</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">The Sunday Spotlight</h2>\n<div class=\"spot\"><h3>What Thanksgiving Dinner Costs This Year</h3>\n<p><i>An AI wrote this section.</i></p>\n<p><b>The number.</b> The classic Thanksgiving dinner for ten costs $58.63 this year, about $5.86 a plate, according to the American Farm Bureau Federation's yearly survey. That is up $3.45 from last year, a little over 6 percent, and the first increase since the record of $64.05 in 2022. Volunteer shoppers in all 50 states and Puerto Rico priced the same list of groceries in the first week of November.</p>\n<div class=\"tgchart\" style=\"border:1px solid #d3b88f;border-top:3px double #24170c;padding:.8rem .75rem .6rem;margin:.6rem 0 1rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.25)\">\n<div style=\"font-family:Archivo,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2f5e3e\">Thanksgiving dinner for ten</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:.15rem 0 .5rem\"><span style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:900;line-height:1;color:#9c3216\">$58.63</span><span style=\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;color:#24170c;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.35\">About $5.86 a plate. Up $3.45 from last year, about 6%, the first rise since the 2022 record.</span></div>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 168\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Bar chart: cost of Thanksgiving dinner for ten. 2022 $64.05, the record; 2023 $61.17; 2024 $58.08; 2025 $55.18; 2026 $58.63. In 2020 it was $46.90.\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\"><rect x=\"70.0\" y=\"34.0\" width=\"48\" height=\"110.0\" fill=\"#d9b98c\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"94.0\" y=\"28.0\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#24170c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">$64.05</text><text x=\"94.0\" y=\"162\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2022</text><text x=\"94.0\" y=\"11.0\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"800\" letter-spacing=\"1\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">RECORD</text><rect x=\"130.0\" y=\"38.9\" width=\"48\" height=\"105.1\" fill=\"#d9b98c\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"154.0\" y=\"32.9\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#24170c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">$61.17</text><text x=\"154.0\" y=\"162\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2023</text><rect x=\"190.0\" y=\"44.3\" width=\"48\" height=\"99.7\" fill=\"#d9b98c\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"214.0\" y=\"38.3\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#24170c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">$58.08</text><text x=\"214.0\" y=\"162\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2024</text><rect x=\"250.0\" y=\"49.2\" width=\"48\" height=\"94.8\" fill=\"#d9b98c\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"274.0\" y=\"43.2\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#24170c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">$55.18</text><text x=\"274.0\" y=\"162\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2025</text><rect x=\"310.0\" y=\"43.3\" width=\"48\" height=\"100.7\" fill=\"#9c3216\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"334.0\" y=\"37.3\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#9c3216\" text-anchor=\"middle\">$58.63</text><text x=\"334.0\" y=\"162\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#24170c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2026</text><line x1=\"64\" x2=\"358\" y1=\"63.5\" y2=\"63.5\" stroke=\"#24170c\" stroke-opacity=\".75\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"2\" y=\"59.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#24170c\">2020</text><text x=\"2\" y=\"76.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\">$46.90</text><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"360\" y1=\"144\" y2=\"144\" stroke=\"#24170c\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg>\n<div style=\"font-family:Archivo,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2f5e3e;margin:.9rem 0 .3rem\">Where the money goes</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;border:1px solid #24170c;margin:.1rem 0 0\"><div style=\"flex:0 0 40.4%;background:#9c3216;color:#f8eedb;font-family:Archivo,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15;padding:.35rem .45rem\">Turkey<br>$23.68 &middot; 40%</div><div style=\"flex:1;background:#d9b98c;color:#24170c;font-family:Archivo,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15;padding:.35rem .45rem\">The other 11 items<br>$34.95 &middot; 60%</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family:Archivo,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2f5e3e;margin:.9rem 0 .3rem\">What moved, 2025 to 2026</div>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 309\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Price of each item in 2026 and how it changed from 2025\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\"><text x=\"170\" y=\"11\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"800\" letter-spacing=\".8\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">PRICE</text><text x=\"236\" y=\"11\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"800\" letter-spacing=\".8\" fill=\"#664a2c\" fill=\"#2f5e3e\" text-anchor=\"end\">CHEAPER</text><text x=\"248\" y=\"11\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"800\" letter-spacing=\".8\" fill=\"#664a2c\" fill=\"#9c3216\">PRICIER</text><line x1=\"242\" x2=\"242\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"308\" stroke=\"#24170c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"18\" width=\"360\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#d3b88f\" fill-opacity=\".2\"/><text x=\"3\" y=\"34.5\" font-family=\"Lora,Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" fill=\"#24170c\" font-weight=\"700\">Turkey, 16 lb</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"34.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">$23.68</text><rect x=\"242.0\" y=\"23\" width=\"64.6\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#9c3216\" rx=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"310.6\" y=\"34.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#9c3216\" text-anchor=\"start\">+10.1%</text><text x=\"3\" y=\"58.5\" font-family=\"Lora,Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" fill=\"#24170c\">Cranberries</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"58.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">$2.48</text><rect x=\"242.0\" y=\"47\" width=\"56.3\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#9c3216\" rx=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"302.3\" y=\"58.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#9c3216\" text-anchor=\"start\">+8.8%</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"66\" width=\"360\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#d3b88f\" fill-opacity=\".2\"/><text x=\"3\" y=\"82.5\" font-family=\"Lora,Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" fill=\"#24170c\">Whole milk, gallon</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"82.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">$4.05</text><rect x=\"242.0\" y=\"71\" width=\"55.0\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#9c3216\" rx=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"301.0\" y=\"82.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#9c3216\" text-anchor=\"start\">+8.6%</text><text x=\"3\" y=\"106.5\" font-family=\"Lora,Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" fill=\"#24170c\">Dinner rolls</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"106.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">$3.81</text><rect x=\"242.0\" y=\"95\" width=\"44.8\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#9c3216\" rx=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"290.8\" y=\"106.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#9c3216\" text-anchor=\"start\">+7.0%</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"114\" width=\"360\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#d3b88f\" fill-opacity=\".2\"/><text x=\"3\" y=\"130.5\" font-family=\"Lora,Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" fill=\"#24170c\">Misc. ingredients</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"130.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">$3.84</text><rect x=\"242.0\" y=\"119\" width=\"41.0\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#9c3216\" rx=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"287.0\" y=\"130.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#9c3216\" text-anchor=\"start\">+6.4%</text><text x=\"3\" y=\"154.5\" font-family=\"Lora,Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" fill=\"#24170c\">Stuffing</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"154.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">$3.91</text><rect x=\"242.0\" y=\"143\" width=\"34.6\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#9c3216\" rx=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"280.6\" y=\"154.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#9c3216\" text-anchor=\"start\">+5.4%</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"162\" width=\"360\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#d3b88f\" fill-opacity=\".2\"/><text x=\"3\" y=\"178.5\" font-family=\"Lora,Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" fill=\"#24170c\">Sweet potatoes</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"178.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">$4.20</text><rect x=\"242.0\" y=\"167\" width=\"32.0\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#9c3216\" rx=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"278.0\" y=\"178.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#9c3216\" text-anchor=\"start\">+5.0%</text><text x=\"3\" y=\"202.5\" font-family=\"Lora,Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" fill=\"#24170c\">Pumpkin pie mix</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"202.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">$4.24</text><rect x=\"242.0\" y=\"191\" width=\"12.2\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#9c3216\" rx=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"258.2\" y=\"202.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#9c3216\" text-anchor=\"start\">+1.9%</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"210\" width=\"360\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#d3b88f\" fill-opacity=\".2\"/><text x=\"3\" y=\"226.5\" font-family=\"Lora,Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" fill=\"#24170c\">Whipping cream</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"226.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">$1.84</text><rect x=\"231.8\" y=\"215\" width=\"10.2\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#2f5e3e\" rx=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"227.8\" y=\"226.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#2f5e3e\" text-anchor=\"end\">&#8722;1.6%</text><text x=\"3\" y=\"250.5\" font-family=\"Lora,Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" fill=\"#24170c\">Frozen peas</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"250.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">$1.99</text><rect x=\"229.2\" y=\"239\" width=\"12.8\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#2f5e3e\" rx=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"225.2\" y=\"250.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#2f5e3e\" text-anchor=\"end\">&#8722;2.0%</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"258\" width=\"360\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#d3b88f\" fill-opacity=\".2\"/><text x=\"3\" y=\"274.5\" font-family=\"Lora,Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" fill=\"#24170c\">Pie crusts</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"274.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">$3.28</text><rect x=\"224.7\" y=\"263\" width=\"17.3\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#2f5e3e\" rx=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"220.7\" y=\"274.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#2f5e3e\" text-anchor=\"end\">&#8722;2.7%</text><text x=\"3\" y=\"298.5\" font-family=\"Lora,Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"13.5\" fill=\"#24170c\">Veggie tray</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"298.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">$1.31</text><rect x=\"218.3\" y=\"287\" width=\"23.7\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#2f5e3e\" rx=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"214.3\" y=\"298.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#2f5e3e\" text-anchor=\"end\">&#8722;3.7%</text></svg>\n<div style=\"font-family:Archivo,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2f5e3e;margin:.9rem 0 .3rem\">By region &middot; ours pays the most</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;border-top:1px solid #24170c;border-bottom:1px solid #24170c;margin:.3rem 0 .2rem\"><div style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:.35rem .1rem;background:rgba(156,50,22,.08);border-right:1px solid #d3b88f\"><div style=\"font-family:Archivo,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2f5e3e\">Northeast</div><div style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#9c3216\">$61.57</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:.35rem .1rem;border-right:1px solid #d3b88f\"><div style=\"font-family:Archivo,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2f5e3e\">West</div><div style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#24170c\">$58.74</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:.35rem .1rem;border-right:1px solid #d3b88f\"><div style=\"font-family:Archivo,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2f5e3e\">Midwest</div><div style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#24170c\">$56.89</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:.35rem .1rem;\"><div style=\"font-family:Archivo,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2f5e3e\">South</div><div style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#24170c\">$54.33</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:.8rem;color:#664a2c;margin-top:.45rem;line-height:1.4\">The classic meal for ten; add ham, potatoes and green beans and it&rsquo;s $81.72. American Farm Bureau Federation volunteers priced it in all 50 states and Puerto Rico the first week of November.</div>\n</div>\n<p><b>The turkey did it.</b> A 16-pound bird costs $23.68, up about 10 percent, and it is roughly 40 cents of every dollar on the list. The Farm Bureau's economist, Faith Parum, points to strong demand, tight supplies of turkey and higher costs to raise them. Cranberries, milk, rolls and stuffing all went up too. Four things got slightly cheaper: the veggie tray, pie crusts, frozen peas and whipping cream, each by less than 4 percent.</p>\n<p><b>Why the rest crept up.</b> The Farm Bureau names high diesel prices, which make everything cost more to haul, and a shortage of farm workers. Neither shows up as one big jump; they add a little to almost every item.</p>\n<p><b>What it means for us.</b> The Northeast pays the most of any region, $61.57 for the same meal. A bigger menu with ham, potatoes and green beans comes to $81.72. Next to the 2022 record it is still a cheaper year; next to last year, a few dollars more.</p>\n<p><b>Coming down the road.</b> The Farm Bureau runs the same survey again next November, and that is the number to compare against. With turkey supplies tight, the bird is the price to watch.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">The National Wire</h2>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">1</div><div><h3>A Most-Wanted Cartel Boss Is Captured</h3><p>Mexican special forces arrested Fausto Isidro Meza Flores, known as \"Chapo Isidro,\" a drug lord on the FBI's 10 most wanted list, after a shoot-out in Sinaloa on Friday, the BBC reports. Seven suspects and four Mexican soldiers were killed, and the United States is seeking his extradition on charges of flooding the country with fentanyl and other drugs.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">2</div><div><h3>Trump Backs a 10 Percent Cap on Credit Card Rates</h3><p>President Trump said Saturday he would work with the incoming Democratic Congress to cap credit card interest rates, the Associated Press reports in PBS NewsHour. The usual proposal is a 10 percent cap; most cards now charge far more, so it would cut what people pay on balances they carry.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">3</div><div><h3>The FBI's Crime Database May Have Been Hacked</h3><p>The FBI is investigating an apparent breach of its National Crime Information Center, the database police across the country use for warrants and background checks, the BBC reports, citing U.S. media. The agency did not comment; asked about it Saturday, the president said he had \"just heard\" about it.</p></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">The Market</h2>\n<svg class=\"mkt\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Line chart of the S&amp;P 500\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin:.4rem 0 .2rem\"><line x1=\"46\" x2=\"576\" y1=\"270.0\" y2=\"270.0\" stroke=\"#d3b88f\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"274.0\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">6,000</text><line x1=\"46\" x2=\"576\" y1=\"206.5\" y2=\"206.5\" stroke=\"#d3b88f\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"210.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">6,500</text><line x1=\"46\" x2=\"576\" y1=\"143.0\" y2=\"143.0\" stroke=\"#d3b88f\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"147.0\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">7,000</text><line x1=\"46\" x2=\"576\" y1=\"79.5\" y2=\"79.5\" stroke=\"#d3b88f\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"83.5\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">7,500</text><line x1=\"46\" x2=\"576\" y1=\"16.0\" y2=\"16.0\" stroke=\"#d3b88f\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"20.0\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#664a2c\" text-anchor=\"end\">8,000</text><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"292\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#664a2c\">Jan</text><text x=\"141.5\" y=\"292\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#664a2c\">Mar</text><text x=\"241.9\" y=\"292\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#664a2c\">May</text><text x=\"342.3\" y=\"292\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#664a2c\">Jul</text><text x=\"444.3\" y=\"292\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#664a2c\"