urnal</i> reports. Niagara County Legislature chair Mike Hill told the paper the county doesn't get federal housing money directly; it flows through the Homeless Alliance of Western New York, which hands it out in competitive grants.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">2</div><div><h3>Niagara Falls &middot; Fewer Shootings</h3><p>Shootings with injuries fell 13 percent statewide in the first 10 months of 2026 in the communities in New York's gun-violence program, the <i>Lockport Union-Sun &amp; Journal</i> reports. Niagara Falls police are one of the 29 departments in it, and they reported fewer shootings than at this point last year.</p></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">The Marquee</h2>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">1</div><div><h3>Miley Cyrus Is Married</h3><p>Miley Cyrus married drummer Maxx Morando on Saturday at a private home in Palm Springs, Page Six reports, after five years together. Her parents, Billy Ray and Tish Cyrus, were there, and the Flaming Lips' Wayne Coyne, who made a 2015 album with her, officiated.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">2</div><div><h3>Britney Spears Says Sorry to Her Family</h3><p>Britney Spears apologized on Instagram on Saturday to the family she has feuded with publicly for years, Page Six reports. \"I'm so very sorry for bringing up past issues,\" she wrote, saying she had done it to protect her heart.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">3</div><div><h3>No New <i>American Psycho</i></h3><p>Director Luca Guadagnino says his new film of Bret Easton Ellis's novel <i>American Psycho</i> is off, the Hollywood Reporter says. \"Unfortunately for me, as we speak, it's not happening,\" he said on a Deadline podcast, without saying why.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">4</div><div><h3>E.J. Carroll, 66</h3><p>E.J. Carroll, a character actor seen on <i>Law &amp; Order</i> and <i>Boardwalk Empire</i>, died after collapsing on a New York City street Thursday on his way to a voiceover job, Us Weekly reports. He was 66, and a cause of death has not been determined.</p></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">The Gridiron</h2>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div><h3>Bills: Dolphins at 1, Shorthanded</h3><p>The Bills host Miami at 1 p.m. without cornerback Christian Benford and linebacker Dorian Williams, both ruled out Friday, ProFootballTalk reports, and called up linebacker Shaq Thompson and cornerback Tre'Davious White from the practice squad to cover, Buffalo Rumblings reports; defensive tackle Ed Oliver was added late as questionable with a side injury, along with Damar Hamlin and T.J. Sanders. Josh Allen has 11 rushing touchdowns; one more would make him only the fifth player ever with four straight seasons of 12 or more, and the first who isn't a running back.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div><h3>Jets at Chargers, 4:05</h3><p>The Jets play in Los Angeles this afternoon; kickoff is 4:05 Eastern.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"part\"><span>The Almanac</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">The Weather Glass</h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:.8rem;align-items:center;margin:.5rem 0 .7rem\"><img src=\"/assets/margo.svg\" alt=\"Margo Bentham, in silhouette\" style=\"width:86px;height:auto;flex:none\"><div><div style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.1\">Margo Bentham</div><div style=\"font-family:Archivo,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.6rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal,#2f5e3e);margin-top:.2rem\">Editor-in-chief &middot; lead meteorologist</div><div style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--soft,#664a2c);margin-top:.3rem\">Has never once been seen at the office.</div></div></div>\n<p class=\"wlede\">Sixty-five and sunny in late November. Enjoy the hell out of it, because Tuesday night it's 25.</p>\n<div class=\"touch-head\" style=\"margin-top:1.1rem\">Today</div>\n<div class=\"wxrow\">\n  <div class=\"wxc\"><div class=\"k\">Tonight</div><div class=\"v\">42&deg;</div><div class=\"s\">showers late</div></div>\n  <div class=\"wxc\"><div class=\"k\">Wind</div><div class=\"v\">8</div><div class=\"s\">mph, south</div></div>\n  <div class=\"wxc\"><div class=\"k\">Rain</div><div class=\"v\">28%</div><div class=\"s\">after 1 a.m.</div></div>\n  <div class=\"wxc\"><div class=\"k\">Normal</div><div class=\"v\">45&deg;</div><div class=\"s\">for the date</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"lbl t\">Next 24 hours</span></div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 150\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:460px;height:auto;margin:0 auto .5rem\" data-start=\"5\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hourly temperatures and rain chances for North Tonawanda over the next 24 hours, high 65, low 46\"><rect x=\"14.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"27.1\" height=\"84\" fill=\"#24170c\" opacity=\".07\"/><rect x=\"176.8\" y=\"12\" width=\"149.2\" height=\"84\" fill=\"#24170c\" opacity=\".07\"/><polygon points=\"14.0,96 14.0,96.0 27.6,96.0 41.1,96.0 54.7,88.6 68.3,70.2 81.8,55.5 95.4,40.7 109.0,33.4 122.5,26.0 136.1,26.0 149.7,26.0 163.2,29.7 176.8,40.7 190.3,55.5 203.9,66.5 217.5,66.5 231.0,66.5 244.6,70.2 258.2,70.2 271.7,70.2 285.3,70.2 298.9,73.9 312.4,77.6 326.0,81.3 326.0,96\" fill=\"#9c3216\" opacity=\".10\"/><polyline points=\"14.0,96.0 27.6,96.0 41.1,96.0 54.7,88.6 68.3,70.2 81.8,55.5 95.4,40.7 109.0,33.4 122.5,26.0 136.1,26.0 149.7,26.0 163.2,29.7 176.8,40.7 190.3,55.5 203.9,66.5 217.5,66.5 231.0,66.5 244.6,70.2 258.2,70.2 271.7,70.2 285.3,70.2 298.9,73.9 312.4,77.6 326.0,81.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9c3216\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"281.1\" y=\"115.0\" width=\"8.4\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#7fb2c9\"/><rect x=\"294.7\" y=\"114.0\" width=\"8.4\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#7fb2c9\"/><rect x=\"308.2\" y=\"115.0\" width=\"8.4\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#7fb2c9\"/><rect x=\"321.8\" y=\"115.0\" width=\"8.4\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#